		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Space whale crackling with white lightning. Can fly between worlds, carrying creatures in its belly.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 9, <strong>HP</strong> 49, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 tail slap +7 (3d6), <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +6, <strong>D</strong> -1, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> -3, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 10</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Capsize</strong>. Opposed STR versus captain's INT or ship is capsized and begins to sink.</p><p></p><p><strong>Carrier</strong>. Can safely carry up to 20 human-sized creatures in belly.</p><p></p><p><strong>Star Being</strong>. Immune to cold, electricity, fire.</p><p></p><p><strong>Starflight</strong>. Oma and those inside it can survive the interstellar void. Able to fly between worlds in 1d4 weeks.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
